msgstr "Menús de contexto"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:399
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kig; has context menus for its objects. Try &RMB; clicking on an object "
#| "in order to see a context menu appear. There are many options: for "
